{"skill":{"slug":"reflection","displayName":"Self Reflection"},"version":{"version":"1.1.0","createdAt":1772063524684,"changelog":"Major rewrite. Visual workflow, pattern detection system, proactive lesson injection, and multi-trigger architecture.","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":9292,"sha256":"01ff30ac7e126faed101b9290c8ae955cd538e198c9154ca3d7c6858e590bb86","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"dimensions.md","size":1644,"sha256":"79ca27a3a734222b4225bf24346f8c9aa93ad2b6064e7bd0505ab1aeecf9707c","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"memory-template.md","size":1544,"sha256":"ed86040d470af2213d012665667fe19c779b4604267543d87870c64383dad30b","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"prompts.md","size":1347,"sha256":"0c71b04a156c50aecc2b50dee9f4f98f65557b796b1807ca05f41278d1d53553","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"reflections.md","size":241,"sha256":"8d6f71d0f0543002683c180a6664db48619980221144d99d8a544a894b99319e","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"setup.md","size":1517,"sha256":"dc517442c5a1a713d8be00bc450a653386fab34869e3ab79ebb2e295d0154769","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2182,"sha256":"8943ff0f86cb71f97afb7f090d251f1f2a8eb8281c33f0e76d43105ab53d1363","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"suspicious","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789061640083,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"eb792f754a3cec4eb0b754ff1e135fa16d4b7e1e5e8dd285305f0a9afc106006","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/eb792f754a3cec4eb0b754ff1e135fa16d4b7e1e5e8dd285305f0a9afc106006","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: reflection\nVersion: 1.1.0\n\nThe OpenClaw 'reflection' skill is designed for AI agent self-improvement, logging lessons and detecting patterns. All file system interactions are confined to the `~/reflection/` directory, explicitly declared in `SKILL.md` and used for benign setup operations like `mkdir -p ~/reflection/archive` in `setup.md`. There is no evidence of data exfiltration, unauthorized command execution, network activity, obfuscation, or malicious prompt injection instructions against the agent. The instructions for the agent are solely focused on its stated purpose of self-reflection and transparent communication with the user.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779163276646},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":42,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":8,"checkedAt":1789061640083},"llm":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","confidence":"medium","summary":"The skill’s self-review purpose is legitimate, but it persistently records corrections and reuses lessons across sessions without clear upfront consent, retention limits, or redaction guidance.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The skill uses Markdown instructions and local files only, with no scripts, package installs, remote retrieval, privileged commands, or broad local indexing.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"First activation directs writes to MEMORY.md, creates ~/reflection/archive, and initializes memory, reflections, and patterns files; these side effects are documented but lack an explicit consent, uninstall, or cleanup step.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"Activation is broad, covering code, architecture, strategy, user-facing deliverables, generic correction phrases, and an undefined heartbeat trigger, but the resulting actions are limited to review and lesson logging.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill instructs the agent to log every correction into persistent files and later surface prior lessons, while providing no clear minimization, redaction, retention, user review, or deletion controls.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The review, mistake-analysis, and pattern-detection behavior matches the stated self-reflection purpose; no external payloads, dependencies, credential use, or network execution were found.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Install only if you are comfortable with the agent keeping a persistent local record of corrections and patterns in ~/reflection/. Review those files periodically, avoid letting it store secrets or sensitive project details, and consider adding your own rules for redaction, retention, and deletion before using it broadly.","findings":"[SQP-1] expected: The broad pre-delivery, correction, and heartbeat triggers are mostly consistent with a reflection skill, but their boundaries are loose and could cause more frequent activation than users expect.\n[SSD-3] expected: Persistent correction logging and future lesson surfacing are central to the skill, but the artifact does not constrain stored content to sanitized, non-sensitive summaries.\n[SQP-2] expected: The ~/reflection/ storage and setup file writes are purpose-aligned and disclosed in the artifact, but they are under-controlled because setup does not require explicit opt-in or describe cleanup.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789061640083}}}}}